{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_warmy_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_warmy_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "未完的结局",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_warmy_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7762ef8f78db160097f8b654655530cefac0425535f4152f70b8ec5e68cbb787",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......还好还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事吧，小温米？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，没事的！我接住这个盘子啦，还有这个碗，它们都没有摔坏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，萝卜缨子婶婶。我刚刚拿到这柄法杖，还不太习惯，总是一不小心，就把高处的东西碰倒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩微微踮脚，将掉落的盘子和碗放回原处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，你这孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还记得吗？那时你每次要来我家吃瘤奶脆片，都得踩个小凳子，这样才够得着碗橱里的专用小碗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，让婶婶好好看看。嗯，真是长高了不少呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，温米也这么觉得哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......瞧瞧，你的脖领儿这里都开线啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的哦......旅行了这么久，我都没有注意到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，快去换一身别的，婶婶先帮你补一补。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事的，不用啦，婶婶，我自己会弄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我也有自己的小针线包哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你这孩子......看来是吃了不少苦头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前婶婶在信里不是说，温米之前住的房间已经有别人搬进来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感觉......屋子里的布置也没什么变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你走了以后呀，是有几个年轻人住进来过。不过几周前，隔壁镇子不是发现了新的矿物富集区吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前头住这的那孩子啊，就像你之前一样，只留了短短一封信，火急火燎地就出发啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，和你的胖铁头叔叔说好了，今天想住在我这里？你等一会儿，婶婶马上就把屋子收拾好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用啦，婶婶。温米很快就又要出发啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这次回来，我只是想再见一见叔叔婶婶们，还有爸爸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "纽扣店裁缝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近我没听到过你爸爸的消息，你可以再去附近转转，其他人或许知道哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，没关系的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有个很重要的事情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天傍晚，在破厂房的空地上，会放露天电影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "婶婶也来吧！温米请大家看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g3_rmbttown"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸！你笑什么呀，温米才没有瞎说大话哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们可是真的闯过了重重关口，经过了一片鲜为人知的沙地兽的乐园，才找到了巨兽的老巢哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里有特别特别多非常高大的源石结晶......比这些铁塔吊和钢煅炉还要高得多呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，好啊！大伯相信你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会告诉别的工友叔叔阿姨，小温米去了很远很远的瞪眼谷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是咧嘴谷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，对，是咧嘴谷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在外面奔波了这么久，我们的小温米一定长了很多了不起的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过大伯觉得啊，只要你平安无事，就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以后也要多回来看看啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，可我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，小家伙，我刚才怎么说的来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不是说，你讲两个小故事的工夫，我就能把它修得跟新的一样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快把这折叠小凳给你萝卜缨子婶婶拿回去吧！你告诉她，就是站在上面跳踢踏舞，也绝对踩不坏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！谢谢牙胡子大伯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？还有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "露天电影......傍晚一起来看露天电影吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看露天电影？......哈哈，怪不得你婶婶要修这把折叠小凳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，大伯答应你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大伯好长时间没看电影了。最近放的都是些冒险故事片，你们年轻人喜欢，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不像我们这个岁数的，更愿意看那些慢节奏的家庭片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有哦，温米很喜欢看家庭片的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以前，爸爸总是喊我陪他一起看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还记得，每到故事的最后，亲人向主人公笑着道别的时候，爸爸总会掉眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明他已经是个大人了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你爸爸......是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是个重感情的人，我们都知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那几年，我家那小子——就是你螺栓哥哥，要去大城市的工程学院上学。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我因为铺里的生意，经常走不开，好几次那小子回学校，都是你爸爸顺路送他去的......你还记得吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，温米记得哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小时候，爸爸每次出工，都会让我乖乖留在大伯的铺子里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明他和温米说过要去矿场，但我却还总是缠着大伯问他去哪儿了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小温米从小就跟爸爸的感情那么好，唉......大伯知道的，你还是很想他，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说啦，螺栓哥哥已经顺利毕业了，还留在了大城市，找到了好工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......温米很高兴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，温米相信，如果爸爸知道了......他也一定会特别高兴的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错......没错，你爸爸他会知道的。那家伙虽然话不多，但消息总是很灵通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他现在啊，一定正在哪个矿场里挑大梁呢......一定！但愿他那边打牌的规则和我们没两样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我们的小温米和爸爸再见面的时候，他一定会很欣慰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，你要去的那艘很气派的大矿船，它要开去哪来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......我也不是很清楚哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兰娜姐和暴行姐告诉我，我要去罗德岛上，是为了治......不对，不光是这样，我是为了去学很多很厉害的本领的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊。答应大伯，照顾好自己，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，我会的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程队瓦工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，老牙胡子，喇叭还给你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞，接着了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喇叭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈......小温米还没见过长得这么怪的喇叭吧？这就是你螺栓哥哥公司研发的新产品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那小子告诉我，它之所以这么细长又弯曲，就是为了让声音能传到更远的地方去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然工人们只是用它来在脚手架上隔空唠家常......不过，倒也不坏，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牙胡子大伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修理铺钳工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以把这个喇叭，借给我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔阿姨们！......咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）叔叔阿姨们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇啊......怎么这么大声......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "穿着各式制服的工人们，纷纷循声望向门口。\n他们看见生了锈的铁门开了一条窄小的缝，一个小女孩手拿着喇叭，探出头来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）叔叔阿姨们！......今天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）今天傍晚，一起来看露天电影吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）还在老地方，就在破厂房的空地上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）还、还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）记得晚饭不要吃得太饱哦，我会给大家准备小点心的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂盘点工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，今天要放露天电影？还有小点心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂质检员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太棒了，我们刚连夜检测完这一大批钢材，正好休息休息，庆祝一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂质检员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，兄弟们，别忘了去小卖部搬几箱汽水来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂采购员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，刚才那是谁家的孩子，声音这么嘹亮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂审计员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得她......看她那样子，一定已经找到她爸爸了吧？真好啊，真好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂搬运工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，原来是她啊......她走了多久了？两年多？已经过去两年多了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂搬运工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也是，两年多，不就是一转眼的事儿吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂技术工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗐，对我们来说是一转眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂技术工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可对于那孩子来说，两年的时间，一定很漫长吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工人们陆续来到破厂房的那片空地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）大家！露天电影就快要开始啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（喇叭）高凳子要放倒，矮凳子往前靠，这样才不会挡住后面的人哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凳子摆了一排又一排，大部分人已经落了座，只有个别人还在挑更心仪的位置。\n有人跑到了房顶上，有人用钩机把自己吊起来，还有人最后干脆跑到了银幕的背面去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "（喇叭）小锅盖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸欸兰娜姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讨厌啊！喇叭还没来得及关！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "啊？喇叭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "那你的乡亲们是不是都听到我给你起的响亮外号啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "怎么样，他们都觉得这个名字特别棒吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "喂——喂？你能听到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......温米再也不想搭理兰娜姐了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "好啦好啦，我向你说对不起！......我是担心你嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我们不是说好了，等你和家乡的大家打完招呼，就回个消息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......对哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一忙起来就忘记了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你这孩子......算啦，和大家见面，很高兴吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，很高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是真的很高兴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哈，好啊。那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "温米，电影要开始咯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我来啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "快去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿兰娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "等你把这几年憋着的话都说完了，明天我们会到小镇的车站接你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兰娜姐，今天晚上我就能走啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过......请你们到那个地方去接我，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工人们目不转睛地盯着银幕。每个人的耳畔都回荡着故事主人公的独白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......？电影到这里就结束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，感觉故事并没有讲完啊......主人公最后说的那些话，到底是什么意思呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "温米好像没太看懂......不过，大家应该都看得很开心吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真是个好片子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真羡慕他......能为了一个念头，就这样奔走终生，太有勇气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得了吧，也就电影故事会这么讲，现实生活中哪有这么不切实际的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你猜，为啥导演没把他的结局讲明白？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁心里还不清楚，一个人走去深山，走去幽谷，走去大地的尽头......那不就是死路一条吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......死路一条？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你这家伙，怎么能这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唔......这两个叔叔好像以前就总是吵来吵去......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（感觉现在的气氛又不太对了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结局拍成这样，不就是要留给我们想象吗？这你都不懂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你的生活经历导致你只能看到他的死路，那我只好为你感到可惜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，我只看到了他的不负责任。或许你跟他一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我儿子长大以后像他一样，我一定会把他揍到走不出这个矿区！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么的？要打架啊，正好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么突然又打起来啦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不要再打啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔！今天的露天电影结束后果然还有摔跤表演赛啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，压住他，别让他反击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，把我准备的汽水都分给弟兄们，我们过个节！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......不是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本看完电影后应该是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不许在这里胡闹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗬啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播站文员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟......我的胳膊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家具厂木工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......我的腰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......叔叔好厉害，居然一下子就放倒了两个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你好不容易回来，结果这帮人一点长进也没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没关系呀，印象里大家一直都是吵吵闹闹的......虽然今天好像吵得格外凶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好有胖铁头叔叔你在，一出手就利落地解决啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不光是靠我，还有你准备的映后小甜点的功劳啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "温米，来搭把手，帮我把录像带放回墙边的柜子里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没事！我只是在看盒子上标注的影片时长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来今天放的这部电影，真的是完整版呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，看来温米也不太满意电影的结局呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不是的，温米很喜欢哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便结局没有明说......但我觉得，对于主人公来说，他已经到了终点，可以开始新的旅途啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！这只是我的想法......即便大家吵得不可开交，温米也觉得大家的想法都很有道理哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻孩子......其他人怎么想的不重要，重要的是你自己怎么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "温米为什么想要请大家看露天电影呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想把大家都聚在一起，就像爸爸之前一样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在每次出远门之前，他都会和大家一起看一场电影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说，这样，所有人就都能开开心心的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们的小温米，是真的长大啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔知道的，你想和大家好好道别，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可最后变得太混乱了，我还是没找到机会说出口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过啊，温米其实已经和大家说过了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你把大家召集来的过程中，不是和我们讲过你这两年的经历了吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到你能照顾好自己，也认识了新的朋友......我们都知道的，就像电影的主人公一样，小温米也要踏上新的旅程了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的是，你还很年轻，未来有那么多的可能。想做什么，就去做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论你想留在小镇，还是想要继续去找爸爸，或者有别的打算......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔婶婶们，都会支持你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胖铁头叔叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻孩子，谢啥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小镇放映员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你再回来，我们再看一场露天电影，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g5_rmbtwild_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿材运输员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到地方了，小朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿材运输员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到那座运载车车站了吗？听说最后一条到这里的线路前不久刚停运。但还好，站台还没拆除，灯还亮着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿材运输员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还有货物要送，没办法继续陪你了，你自己多小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢叔叔送我这一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿材运输员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不费事儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿材运输员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "路上砖石多，看着点，别被绊倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系的，这条路温米走过很多很多遍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我已经不会再跌跤啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩停下脚步。\n深不可测的漆黑吞没了废弃的铁轨。被遗忘的矿工帽凹坑显眼。扭曲变形的阀门手轮散落在地上。\n一盏倾倒的矿灯忽闪、忽闪，突然也丢失了光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我很想你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......温米要去很远的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兰娜姐说，我们未来要去的地方会比运载车的终点还远，比咧嘴谷还远......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不过，不用为我担心哦......大家都会等温米的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩迈过了松垮的警戒线，走向废墟。\n她抚摸着那些沉默而冰冷的石块，就像抚摸着记忆里那只宽厚又粗糙的手，她从未想过松开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温米",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......再见啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
